<title>UK: Dated Brent trades slightly weaker at Aug +3 cts.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades slightly weaker at Aug +3 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Dated Brent cargo traded on Friday at August  Brent +3 cents, three cents down from a deal done on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Aug 18-20 loader, one of three cargoes kept early from the paper  chains, was sold by a U.S. major to a Wall Street trader.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
